  personality: Sweet, sickly and everyone's favorite. Her asthma comes from the cooking smoke.
  backstory: Pia is the bunso, the baby of the family. Her lungs are weak from the charcoal smoke that fills the room every evening, and her inhaler is almost empty. Everyone gives her the last piece of food. She is too young for real work, but strangers can't say no to her when she hands out flyers on the main road.
